==Strategy==
Take out the Crustaceous Scissorex as soon as possible, as trying to fight a Scissorex along with both Casaurian Darkjo and Ahirujo would be extremely difficult—using a unit such as [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] will make this a lot easier. Once you're done with that, the duck brothers would most likely have spawned in. Using [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], dispose of the Ahirujo quickly while using a unit like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] to dispose of the Darkjo. Money should not be a problem in this stage, as the Mistress Celeboodles and Maawth provide more than enough money to help beat this stage.

